      "message": "Instead of hard-coding this, should we check them against the pre-filter again?  That way if someone does something strange like adding a pipeline that triggers on ref-replicated events, it would continue to work?\n\nI say that because I think the only reason we\u0027re doing this is because we\u0027re bypassing the pre-filter on these two events in order to get them into the peek queue, but once they\u0027re out, we don\u0027t care any more.  So reverting to the previous behavior, whatever it was, sounds maybe a little more correct?",
